{"productId": "9084e944-0b55-4f75-b050-456c124e870f", "modelName": "X-Bolt 2 Medallion Carbon Fiber", "modelDescription": "Deftly walking the ridgeline between tradition and technology you\u2019ll find a unique rifle, the Browning X-Bolt Medallion Carbon Fiber. The X-Bolt 2 Medallion Carbon Fiber was developed for the hunter that prefers the tradition of a wood stock and appreciates the improvements that technology provides. The standout feature is the wrapped carbon fiber barrel from Preferred Barrels. Extensive research and testing of Preferred Barrels products has ensured their quality levels and accuracy. Each barrel begins as a blank that is precision bored and button rifled before being stress relieved. The barrels use a stronger, stiffer carbon fiber wrapping process rather than simple carbon fiber sleeve or tube construction like less expensive designs that offer the carbon fiber look without the functional benefits of the wrapping process. Barrels come in standard lengths that vary by caliber. The muzzle is threaded 5/8\"-24 and is ready for use with an optional suppressor. A Recoil Hawg muzzle brake and thread protector cap are included. The action is bedded and the barrel is free floated for consistent accuracy. ", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "9f7c206c-ea16-4fcb-bfe4-dcdae2be4dc9", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt 2 Medallion Carbon Fiber, Bolt Action, 308 Winchester, 22\" Threaded Carbon Fiber Barrel, Muzzle Brake, Matte Black Finish, Black Walnut Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/1e25f72e-026d-48f4-8cf1-91ec181e9adb"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "036090218", "upc": "023614864677", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5d7cb225-7607-4efe-ad2f-d56197e694de", "attributeName": "Adjustable Stock", "attributeValueId": "f3810c6c-d0fc-424a-81ad-cfaf1f11ff2f", "valueName": "No"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e